## Secrets inventory (names only — never values)

GitHub Actions secrets this repo's workflows read. Rotate per
`~/.claude/rules/security/secrets-lifecycle.md`; audit access via GitHub's own secret-access log.

| Secret | Used by | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
{% if release_workflow %}
| `DATABASE_URL` | `release.yml` (`deploy` job) | Only if the project writes `scripts/migrate.sh`: one per GitHub environment (`dev`, `prod`), that environment's connection string for the forward-only migration |
{% endif %}
{% if team_delivery %}
| `PROJECT_TOKEN` | `close-out.yml` | Writes board fields; the default token cannot write to projects |
| `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` | `digest.yml` | Optional; posts the daily waiting digest |
{% endif %}
